<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>GSC-X CommandCenter</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

<style>
.cards-image-section {
  margin: 0 auto;
  max-width: 1500px;
  padding: 0 20px;
}
.cards-image-section h2 {
  color: #ffd34d;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}
.cards-image-section img {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #0e8da5;
  border-radius: 14px;
  box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(0,220,255,0.22);
}

.cardiac-bg{
background:
linear-gradient(rgba(2,10,18,.35),rgba(2,10,18,.45)),
url("assets/cards/cardiac_card_bg.png");
background-size:100%;
background-position:center;
background-repeat:no-repeat;
}



.future-card{
display:flex;
flex-direction:column;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
min-height:330px;
border:1px dashed rgba(0,220,255,.35);
background:rgba(2,10,18,.55);
}

.future-dots{
display:flex;
gap:18px;
margin-bottom:28px;
}

.future-dots span{
width:14px;
height:14px;
border-radius:50%;
background:#17d8ff;
box-shadow:0 0 18px #17d8ff;
animation:pulseDots 1.8s infinite ease-in-out;
}

.future-dots span:nth-child(2){
animation-delay:.3s;
}

.future-dots span:nth-child(3){
animation-delay:.6s;
}

@keyframes pulseDots{
0%,100%{opacity:.35;transform:scale(.9);}
50%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.15);}
}



.robotics-bg{
position:relative;
overflow:hidden;
}


</style>

</head>
<body>

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <img src="/assets/brand/LOGO_WEB.png" alt="GSC-X Command Center" class="brand-logo-web">
  </div>
  </div>
  <nav class="nav">
    <a href="overview.html">OVERVIEW</a>
    <a href="about.html">ABOUT</a>
    <a href="services.html">SERVICES</a>
    <a href="technology.html">TECHNOLOGY</a>
    <a href="sandboxes.html" class="active">SANDBOXES</a>
    <a href="publications.html">PUBLICATIONS</a>
    <a href="validation.html">VALIDATION</a>
    <a href="reports.html">REPORTS</a>
    <a href="repository.html">REPOSITORY</a>
    <a href="author.html">AUTHOR</a>
    <a href="contact.html">CONTACT</a>
    <a href="cs/sandboxes.html">🇨🇿 CZ</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="sandboxes">
  <div class="eyebrow">GSC-X SANDBOX ECOSYSTEM</div>
  <h1>SANDBOXES</h1>
  <p>Domain-oriented validation and demonstration environments built around the GSC-X Executive Kernel architecture.</p>
</section>

<section class="sandbox-grid">

  <div class="sandbox-card industrial-bg" onclick="window.open('https://sandbox.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Industrial Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive executive stabilization for industrial processes, automation systems, production lines, and high-risk machinery.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card reliability-bg" onclick="window.open('https://reliability.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Reliability Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive maintenance, health monitoring, anomaly detection, and early warning for degradation-driven systems.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card fusion-bg" onclick="window.open('https://fusion.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Fusion Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Fusion-inspired instability monitoring and executive stabilization for plasma-like nonlinear dynamic environments.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card robotics-bg" onclick="window.open('https://robotics.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Robotics Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive stabilization and adaptive control support for robotic systems, automation workflows, and embodied AI environments.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card battery-bg" onclick="window.open('https://battery.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Battery Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Battery health monitoring, degradation analysis, predictive warning, and reliability validation across independent datasets.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card spaceflight-bg" onclick="window.open('https://spaceflight.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Spaceflight Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Guidance, autonomy, trajectory stability, mission control support, and predictive stabilization for spaceflight systems.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card nuclear-bg" onclick="window.open('https://nuclear.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Nuclear Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive stabilization and early-warning architecture for nuclear-related monitoring, safety, and high-risk dynamic systems.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>

  <div class="sandbox-card energy-bg" onclick="window.open('https://energy-network.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Energy Network Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Executive stabilization, resilience monitoring, and adaptive decision support for modern energy networks.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
    
  </div>


  <div class="sandbox-card cardiac-bg" onclick="window.open('https://cardiac.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Cardiac Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive executive stabilization, physiological monitoring, early-warning evaluation, phenotype-aware analysis and adaptive decision support for cardiac dynamic systems.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
  </div>





  <div class="sandbox-card internet-bg" onclick="window.open('https://internet.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Internet Infrastructure Sandbox</h2>
    <p>Predictive stabilization and executive monitoring for internet infrastructure, cloud platforms, datacenters and digital communication ecosystems.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
  </div>



  <div class="sandbox-card spectral-bg" onclick="window.open('https://spectral.gds-gsc-x.com', '_blank')" role="link">
    <h2>Spectral Observatory</h2>
    <p>Executive exploration of validated astronomical spectra, morphology analysis and scientific traceability.</p>
    <span class="status active">VALIDATED</span>
  </div>

<div class="sandbox-card future-card">

<div class="future-dots">
<span></span>
<span></span>
<span></span>
</div>

<h2>Coming Soon</h2>

<p>The GSC-X ecosystem continues to expand with new validation domains and research environments.</p>

</div>



</section>
</main>




</body>
</html>
